{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerge from the depths of the ocean and wield the power of a guardian of the seas, and let chaos consume fully destructible environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture across an island of unique levels, packed with challenges and unexpected encounters. Hunt down the mad scientist and leave a trail of destruction in your wake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/extras/87c2b4106070372199fdbca1414ecf70.avif?t=1757502811\" width=618 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy everything, absolutely everything! </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time physics that allow you to collapse the environment in your own way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment as a weapon and throw objects at enemies and structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/extras/22e620088581e61ea20efc30adf599c7.poster.avif?t=1757502811\" width=1562 height=764 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/extras/22e620088581e61ea20efc30adf599c7.webm?t=1757502811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/extras/22e620088581e61ea20efc30adf599c7.mp4?t=1757502811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Hats!?\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gain new abilities to become stronger, faster, and more destructive.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect hats! Creates chaos, but with style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/extras/294b857163b4d71bcdd210b058b54f45.poster.avif?t=1757502811\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/extras/294b857163b4d71bcdd210b058b54f45.apng?t=1757502811\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready for More? Dive Into Extra Modes!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Challenges</strong>: Unique scenarios with challenges to put your skills to the test </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clock Mode</strong>: Speed \u200b\u200bup to the max! Complete the levels as quickly as possible and achieve the best times.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/extras/1994b2a0845dc90d173f0ee9fc77d739.avif?t=1757502811\" width=618 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/extras/48c0ad6b40e4fec0965cfc3f0b70882c.poster.avif?t=1757502811\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/extras/48c0ad6b40e4fec0965cfc3f0b70882c.apng?t=1757502811\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=174 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3388590?t=1757502811","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/ab760713039e8cda6778dea43468b3e37e73f8e0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757502811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388590/62df08088012751d6f535680ab031951fe98adce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757